HR Analytics Dashboard | Power BI

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on exploring HR employee information using Microsoft Power BI. It aims to organize employee data and present HR-related information through data visualizations.

🎯 Project Objective

- Explore employee information.
- Understand employee joining and relieving dates.
- Organize employee records by department.
- Present HR data in a visual dashboard.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

📂 Dataset Description

The project includes an Excel dataset with the following fields:

- Employee_ID
- Employee_Name
- Department
- Joining_Date
- Relieving_Date
- HR_Executive

